    "query": "My grandmother and I are spending Easter Sunday in East London. We want to explore venues in the Tower Hamlets or Southwark districts. Since she uses a wheelchair, every place we visit for sightseeing and meals must be fully wheelchair accessible. We'd love to visit a museum or a major attraction, and have a nice upscale dinner with a view. We're happy to book ahead for our main meal."
  },
